<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR OPENS DOWN AT $65-7/8.</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR OPENS DOWN AT $65-7/8.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia Oy's A share ADR opened down $0-1/4 at $65-7/8 in New York on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The latter price corresponded to about 316.63 markka.</p>
<p>--- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240</p>
